msgid ""
"Spawns mobs when there are players in eyesight, when the player has the "
"ominous trial effect, gets converted to the ominous trial spawner"
msgstr ""
"Erzeugt Kreaturen, wenn Spieler in Sichtweite sind und wenn der Spieler den "
"Unheilvollen Trial Effekt hat, wird in den Unheilvollen Trial Spawner "
"umgewandelt"
